# Layer-set selector template. Copy this file to .powbox-layers (gitignored) to
# pick the layer set built between powbox-agent-base:latest and
# powbox-agent:latest:
#
#   - no .powbox-layers, or one holding only blank and # lines: no layer set;
#     the agent image is built directly on the lean base.
#   - full: the maintainer's bundle in docker/layers/full/, the tools the lean
#     base leaves out: the language toolchains (Go, .NET, PowerShell, PHP, OPA,
#     sqlcmd/bcp, CMake/Ninja/ccache), PostgreSQL 16 with pg-dev-up, rootless
#     Podman, and the browser set's stack.
#   - browser: a headless browser stack in docker/layers/browser/ (Chromium,
#     Marp CLI, Mermaid CLI, the Playwright CLI), for turning decks, diagrams
#     and HTML into PDF or SVG; smaller than full, and the set CI builds.
#   - custom: your own set in docker/layers/custom/ (gitignored apart from its
#     .gitkeep). Start from a copy of a committed set; browser is the smaller
#     starting point: cp -r docker/layers/browser/. docker/layers/custom/
#
# The first line that is neither blank nor a comment names the set. It must
# match ^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._-]*$ and docker/layers/<name>/Dockerfile must exist.
full
